The '''Triple Katana''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[sword]].

Usually bought by [[First Sea]] players, it remains decent for early grinding, as it is very cheap, and has small upgrade costs, however, it has a dash at the fourth m1, slightly reducing the efectiveness for grinding with this sword.

==Obtainment==
The Triple Katana can be bought for {{Money|60,000}} from the [[Sword Dealer of the East]].

