==Trivia==
* The [[Vice Admiral]], [[Fishman Commando]]s, [[Marine Captain]]s, and [[Cake Guard]]s use the Triple Katana as their weapon.
* The Triple Katana is one of the only three [[Swords]] in the game that have three [[Swords]] combined to form one. (Triple Katana, [[True Triple Katana]] and [[Triple Dark Blade]]).
* Most people consider this as a "fake" or "walmart" [[True Triple Katana]], however, this [[Swords|sword]] was released BEFORE [[True Triple Katana]].
* Strangely, this [[Swords|sword]] is much pricier than three separate [[Katana|katanas]], whereas 3 [[Katana|katanas]] would have cost{{Money|15,000}}, this [[Swords|sword]]'s price is {{Money|60,000}}, making this 4x more expensive.
* The Triple Katana shares the same holding animation as The [[Triple Dark Blade]] and The [[True Triple Katana]] due to all of them being three swords being held at the same time.

